Spacewar: the keys
==================

Two ships, one keyboard. Shoot the other ship: five hits and it blows
up, three wins and the game is yours. Hold fire to shoot as fast as the
guns allow.

                 Blue (left)       Red (right)
  Up             Cursor Up         T
  Down           Cursor Down       G
  Left           Cursor Left       F
  Right          Cursor Right      H
  Fire           Return            S

  P              a screenshot, screenshot.bmp in the drawer
  Esc            quit

On a PC keyboard blue fires with Right Ctrl; an Amiga keyboard has one
Ctrl, so the Amiga port uses Return.

The keys every AmiCradle game has on Right Amiga (GFOpenUp's SDL2.module):
Right Amiga + F window or full screen, + P pause, + Q quit, + M free the
mouse pointer, + S a screenshot in the drawer's Screenshots, and Help
shows this file.
